<title>MEXICO: Vitro starts up Mexico City glass line.</title>
<headline>Vitro starts up Mexico City glass line.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitro SA began production at a new $80 million flat glass production line in Mexico City on Wednesday, the Mexican glassmaker and industrial group said.</p>
<p>The new line would allow Vitro to double production capacity to more than 6,100 tonnes per week, a Vitro statement said.</p>
<p>Vitro also said this investment was in addition to $55 million spent in the company's domestic appliances division, to extend a refrigerator plant at Apodaca, in the northern Mexican state of Nuevo Leon.</p>
<p>(( --Daniel Perez, Monterrey bureau +528 345-7617))</p>
